sequenceDiagram
    actor Treasury as PER-053 (Treasury Dealer)
    actor SMF as PER-059 (Senior Manager)
    participant Compliance as SVC-015<br/>Compliance Core
    participant KYC as SVC-014<br/>KYC/AML
    participant EventBus as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant TreasurySvc as SVC-007<br/>Treasury Services
    participant IntlPay as SVC-010<br/>International Payments
    participant Audit as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging

    Note over Treasury,Audit: PH-127 — FATF EDD and KYC Assessment

    Treasury->>Compliance: POST /correspondent-relationships {bic: EAFRKENA, jurisdiction: KE, currency_corridor: GBP-KES}
    Note right of Compliance: Create CorrespondentRelationship (status=under_assessment)
    Compliance->>KYC: Sanctions screening + SWIFT KYC Registry (intra-CAP-005)
    KYC-->>Compliance: sanctions_hit: false; fatf_risk_rating: standard
    Note right of Compliance: Compile EDD documentation
    Compliance-->>Treasury: 201 Created {relationship_id, status: under_assessment}

    Note over Treasury,Audit: PH-128 — Senior Management Approval

    SMF->>Compliance: POST /correspondent-relationships/{id}/approve {sm_attestation_ref: SMF16-2026-XXXX}
    Note right of Compliance: Update status=approved<br/>Record sm_approval_ref and sm_approved_at
    Compliance->>EventBus: Publish CorrespondentEddCompleted (EVT-163)
    EventBus->>TreasurySvc: Consume EVT-163 → Create nostro account for GBP-KES
    EventBus->>IntlPay: Consume EVT-163 → Register BIC EAFRKENA; enable GBP-KES corridor
    EventBus->>KYC: Consume EVT-163 → Set up ongoing AML monitoring (intra-CAP-005)
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-163 → Write immutable EDD + SM approval record

    Note over Treasury,Audit: PH-129 — Nostro Account Setup and SWIFT Registration

    TreasurySvc->>IntlPay: Exchange test SWIFT MT202 — confirm channel live
    Note right of Compliance: Receive nostro_account_id<br/>Update status=active; set annual_review_due_date

    Note over Treasury,Audit: PH-130 — Annual EDD Review Scheduling

    Compliance->>EventBus: Publish CorrespondentOnboarded (EVT-164)
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-164 → Write immutable onboarding record
